==Skin Trivia==
*The current version of the default skin is based on the [[wp:M1 Abrams|American M1 Abrams Tank]].
**The fourth version of the default skin appears to be based on the [[wp:T-90|Russian T-90 Tank]].
**The third and second version of the default skin appeared to have a similar chassis to the [[wp:Crusader tank|British Crusader tank]].
***They may have been inspired by the [[w:c:resistance:M-12 Sabertooth|M-12 Sabertooth Tank]] from ''Resistance: Fall of Man''.
**The first version of the default skin appears to have been based on typical tank chassis, similar to that of the [[wp:Leopard 2|Leopard 2]].
*The {{Color|Premium|Classic}} skin is based on the first version of this unit, though the skin is also based on the [[wp:Challenger 2|Challenger 2]] tank.
*The orange headlights that can be seen mounted on the front of the turret of the fourth version of the default skin are known as the [[wp:Shtora-1|Shtora-1]], a Russian active defense system for tanks, meant to disrupt Anti-Tank missiles, laser rangefinders and other weapons of the like.

===Roblox Catalog===
*The goggles worn by the humanoids that appears on all skins of this vehicle are a re-textured version of the the {{RLinkC|833772989|Laser Spec Special Forces Goggles}} accessory from the Roblox catalog.

